ody3D\n2. Scale it up (eg. `node.scale = Vector3(1.5, 1.5, 1.5)`)\n3. Jump on top of it with another CharacterBody3D\n\nI don't know if this is relevant, but both CharacterBody3D have a spherical/capsule collision shape\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[collision-bug.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21664500/collision-bug.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109390/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109390/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"reopened","pinned_comment":null}